OL,3,ADua Lipa to become first female British
OL,4,Aheadliner at Coachella 2027
OL,5,
OL,6,FCoachella has announced the line-up for
OL,7,Fits 2027 festival, with Dua Lipa set to
OL,8,Fbe the first solo female British artist
OL,9,Fto headline.
OL,11,FThe Training Season singer is top of
OL,12,FFriday's bill for both weekends in
OL,13,FApril, with psych-rock band Tame Impala
OL,14,Fheadlining the Saturday shows and US
OL,15,Fsinger SZA closing out both Sundays.
OL,17,FThe massive festival returns to the
OL,18,FCalifornia desert on 9 to 11 and 16 to
OL,19,F18 April next year, with more than
OL,20,F100,000 fans expected to attend each
OL,21,Fday.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
